    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: right">(8</TD><TD STYLE="padding-right: 4pt; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 1pt; text-align: left">)%</TD><TD STYLE="border-left: Black 1pt solid; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 1pt">&nbsp;</TD>
