                                            additional $3.6 million and $6.9 million were expensed as exploration and evaluation expenditures
                                            in the second quarter and first six months of 2025, respectively (second quarter and first
                                            six months of 2024 - $12.5 million and $23.3 million, respectively).</I></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
