<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">On July&nbsp;30,
2025, the Board of Directors declared a dividend of $0.03 per common share payable on September&nbsp;4, 2025 to shareholders of record
on August&nbsp;21, 2025.</P>

